Departure Mono
--------------
The typeface "Departure Mono" (assets/DepartureMono-Regular.woff2 and
assets/DepartureMono-Regular.woff) is:

  Copyright 2022–2024 Helena Zhang — https://departuremono.com

  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1).
  Full text: assets/DepartureMono-OFL.txt
  Online: https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

The OFL requires that any copy or modification of this repository that keeps
or adapts the font MUST retain the Departure Mono copyright notice and the
OFL-1.1 license text, and MUST keep the font files under the OFL (they cannot
be relicensed under MIT or any other license).

In short: if you copy, fork, or modify this landing and keep the Departure
Mono font, credit "Departure Mono by Helena Zhang" and keep the OFL text in
assets/DepartureMono-OFL.txt.

